<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Metals Techno bid-only on share split.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Metals Techno bid-only on share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hitachi Metals Techno Ltd were bid-only in early morning trade on Tuesday after the company announced on Monday that it would conduct a 1.25-for-1 share split on November 15, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0101 GMT, the shares were bid-only at 1,340 yen after closing at 1,300 on Monday.</p>
